据险，无令敌得入平地，至于流涕；帅厉军士，期于必死，临阵见杀","evidence":["huangli-q-3a910cb638d63807dce2","huangli-q-008c50ce62f462a5ce4d","huangli-q-88668c4110c7053cccf0"]},{"person":"huangli-p0018","role":"随诸葛瞻拒邓艾，临阵授命","evidence":["huangli-q-88a275deef402a0641ef"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":263,"label":"景耀六年冬","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhuge-y263","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhuge-q-o086","basis":"景耀六年冬"},"evidence":["zhuge-e-o086a-q","zhuge-q-o086","zhuge-q-b-3a665f982f59f4321b04"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-o086a-q","source_order":[35,410,"O086a"],"order":6827}],"persons":[{"id":"wgc-p0033","name":"师纂","evidence":["wgc-q0049","wgc-q0123","wgc-q0051","wgc-q0056"],"aliases":[],"facts":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wgc-m-o065-wgc-p0033","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及师纂","evidence":["wgc-q0049"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p042-wgc-p0033","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及师纂","evidence":["wgc-q0123"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o067-wgc-p0033","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及师纂","evidence":["wgc-q0051"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o073-wgc-p0033","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及师纂","evidence":["wgc-q0056"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"duzhou-q-ebb0099964c927cd1134","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-8a67d616dc335860e00f","layer":"original","quote":"景耀六年冬，魏大将（军）邓艾克江由，长驱而前。而蜀本谓敌不便至〖3〗，不作城守调度；及闻艾已入（阴）平〖4〗，百姓扰扰，皆进山野，不可禁制","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":297,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-008c50ce62f462a5ce4d","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-06a51967d1668bb5b546","layer":"original","quote":"瞻盘桓未进〖1〗，崇屡劝瞻“宜速行据险，无令敌得入平（地）”。瞻犹豫未纳，崇至于流涕","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-01c5afceb9b0607b4686","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-417ead1270fb5c2f3823","layer":"original","quote":"会艾长驱而前，瞻却战至绵竹","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-3a910cb638d63807dce2","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-06a51967d1668bb5b546","layer":"original","quote":"随卫将军诸葛瞻拒邓艾，到涪县","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":11,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-88668c4110c7053cccf0","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-417ead1270fb5c2f3823","layer":"original","quote":"崇帅厉军士，期于必死，临阵见杀","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-88a275deef402a0641ef","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-0dc5c04328f7048c3197","layer":"original","quote":"随诸葛瞻拒邓艾，临阵授命，死于绵竹","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":19,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0049","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-f79d34065989623ef2a7","layer":"original","quote":"蜀卫将军诸葛瞻自涪还绵竹〖18〗，列陈待艾。艾遣子惠唐亭侯忠等出其右〖19〗，司马师纂等出其左。忠、纂战不利，并退还，曰：“贼未可击。”艾怒曰：“存亡之分，在此一举；何不可之有！”乃叱忠、纂等，将斩之。忠、纂驰还更战，大破之；斩瞻及尚书张遵等首，进军到雒〖20〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":132,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0051","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3b75cd8087fec2db4ca3","layer":"original","quote":"辄依邓禹故事〖2〗，承制拜禅行骠骑将军，太子奉车〖3〗，诸王驸马都尉〖4〗。蜀群司各随高下，拜为王官，或领艾官属。以师纂领益州刺史，陇西太守牵弘等领蜀中诸郡。使于绵竹筑台以为京观〖5〗，用彰战功。士卒死事者，皆与蜀兵同共埋藏。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":348,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0056","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-2887f1d1c1602f289c32","layer":"original","quote":"钟会、胡烈、师纂等皆白艾所作悖逆，变衅已结〖28〗。诏书槛车征艾〖29〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0077","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a20ce9841d0949b327ba","layer":"original","quote":"艾遂至绵竹，大战，斩诸葛瞻。维等闻瞻已破，率其众东入于巴〖3〗。会乃进军至涪，遣胡烈、田续、庞会等追维〖4〗。艾进军向成都；刘禅诣艾降，遣使敕维等令降于会。维至广汉郪县〖5〗，令兵悉放器仗，送节、传于胡烈〖6〗，便从东道诣会降。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":531,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0079","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-513967ffa2e8c3abfabc","layer":"original","quote":"会内有异志〖1〗，因邓艾承制专事，密白“艾有反状”；﹝一﹞于是诏书槛车征艾。司马文王惧艾或不从命，敕会并进军成都。监军卫瓘在会前行，以文王手笔令宣喻艾军；艾军皆释仗，遂收艾入槛车。会所惮惟艾，艾既擒而会寻至，独统大众，威震西土。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":558,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0123","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-46cb05252baea122f899","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“初，艾之下江由也，以续不进，欲斩，既而舍之。及瓘遣续，谓曰：‘可以报江由之辱矣！’杜预言于众曰：‘伯玉其不免乎！身为名士，位望已高。既无德音，又不御下以正；是小人而乘君子之器，将何以堪其责乎？’瓘闻之，不俟驾而谢。”《世语》曰：“师纂亦与艾俱死。纂，性急少恩，死之日体无完皮。”","attribution":"汉晋春秋；世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-708919d257dd4281bec0","start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0382","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-f79d34065989623ef2a7","layer":"original","quote":"蜀卫将军诸葛瞻自涪还绵竹〖18〗，列陈待艾","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0383","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-f79d34065989623ef2a7","layer":"original","quote":"艾遣子惠唐亭侯忠等出其右〖19〗，司马师纂等出其左。忠、纂战不利，并退还，曰：“贼未可击","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":66,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0384","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-f79d34065989623ef2a7","layer":"original","quote":"艾怒曰：“存亡之分，在此一举；何不可之有！”乃叱忠、纂等，将斩之。忠、纂驰还更战，大破之；斩瞻及尚书张遵等首，进军到雒","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":68,"end":127,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0389","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-3b75cd8087fec2db4ca3","layer":"original","quote":"以师纂领益州刺史，陇西太守牵弘等领蜀中诸郡","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":348,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0397","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-2887f1d1c1602f289c32","layer":"original","quote":"钟会、胡烈、师纂等皆白艾所作悖逆，变衅已结","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0470","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a20ce9841d0949b327ba","layer":"original","quote":"艾遂至绵竹，大战，斩诸葛瞻","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":531,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0484","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-513967ffa2e8c3abfabc","layer":"original","quote":"会内有异志〖1〗，因邓艾承制专事，密白“艾有反状","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":558,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0678","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-46cb05252baea122f899","layer":"pei","quote":"师纂亦与艾俱死。","attribution":"汉晋春秋；世语","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-708919d257dd4281bec0","start":127,"end":135,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o086a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-9fe4ebfa42a59d8d7bb9","layer":"original","quote":"六年冬〖18〗，魏征西将军邓艾伐蜀，自阴平由景谷道旁入〖19〗。瞻督诸军至涪停住；前锋破，退还，住绵竹。艾遣书诱瞻曰：“若降者，必表为琅邪王〖20〗。”瞻怒，斩艾使。遂战，大败；临阵死，时年三十七。众皆离散，艾长驱至成都。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":409,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-3a665f982f59f4321b04","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-3a665f982f59f4321b04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖18〗六年：景耀六年（公元 263）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":429,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5c4c42970dd122437e5b","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o086","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-9fe4ebfa42a59d8d7bb9","layer":"original","quote":"六年冬〖18〗，魏征西将军邓艾伐蜀，自阴平由景谷道旁入〖19〗。瞻督诸军至涪停住；前锋破，退还，住绵竹。艾遣书诱瞻曰：“若降者，必表为琅邪王〖20〗。”瞻怒，斩艾使。遂战，大败；临阵死，时年三十七。众皆离散，艾长驱至成都。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":409,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
